    "title": "Is Costco open today? Holidays that Costco is closed, hours today",
    "text": "NEWSIs Costco open on Presidents Day? Holidays Costco closes, hours today Lori ComstockUSA TODAY NETWORKUpdated Feb. 16, 2026, 5:23 a.m. ETToday is Presidents Day, a federal and bank holiday celebrating Washington's Birthday. Schools close, the mail doesn't run, and USPS deliveries halt, while many stores and some banks open, but what are Costco's holiday hours? Is Costco open or closed on Presidents Day 2026?Not everyone is off President's Day, today, Monday, Feb. 16, since Congress has never declared it a national holiday. Additionally, not every state celebrates President's Day or even spells it the same: New Jersey celebrates Presidents Day as a state holiday (no apostrophe), Pennsylvania spells it with an apostrophe (President's Day), New York celebrates Washington's Birthday (and Lincoln's Birthday as a floating holiday for state employees), and Delaware doesn't celebrate Presidents Day or Washington's Birthday as a state holiday at all.",
